The proof suite now covers symbolic operands for all five operators, left associativity of subtraction and floor division, right associativity of exponentiation, the prompt’s precedence example, and a mixed expression spanning every precedence level. The expected quotient is stated independently as Python’s floored quotient formula from the reference semantics.
