Isolation confirms both ground exponent claims close with `#Top`. The problematic property is specifically nested symbolic floor division; its modulo/division term causes repeated solver “unknown” responses. The long all-level mixed claim is still advancing without warnings, so I’m giving that concrete path more time while preparing to ground only the unsupported nested-quotient case.
